{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark Crescent is a roguelike deck builder with an unique twist.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Procedurally Generated Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541730/extras/battle.gif?t=1740815758\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through increasingly difficult encounters. Face powerful enemies and bosses on your journey towards the moon.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Recruit Your Foes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541730/extras/recruit.gif?t=1740815758\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The last enemy slain will offer his services to you. Will you accept?\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover Powerful Artifacts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541730/extras/artifact.gif?t=1740815758\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip each member of your team with unique boons to alter your playstyle. But beware, as curses are inevitable.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3541730?t=1740815758","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740815758","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541730/7615522c0418dc5df89bef7b84b3ee7acfdcd0ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740815758","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541730/7615522c0418dc5df89bef7b84b3ee7acfdcd0ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740815758","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark Crescent is a roguelik